      "start_seconds": 1.24,
      "end_seconds": 9.0,
      "duration_seconds": 7.76,
      "text": "I mean, hello doctor, sorry, I took a wrong turn on the way here"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 11.01,
      "end_seconds": 14.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "Come in. Please sit. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 15.56,
      "end_seconds": 22.15,
      "duration_seconds": 6.59,
      "text": "Yeah, it's bright red blood on the paper. I don't know what's causing it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.4,
      "end_seconds": 40.71,
      "duration_seconds": 4.31,
      "text": "Right, how many days or weeks has it been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.57,
      "end_seconds": 48.39,
      "duration_seconds": 5.82,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, ever since... since last night, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.07,
      "end_seconds": 51.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "And black stools, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.6,
      "end_seconds": 56.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "No, none, no black stools."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.26,
      "end_seconds": 67.08,
      "duration_seconds": 5.82,
      "text": "Did you get tummy pain, weight loss or change in bowel habit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.75,
      "end_seconds": 70.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "No, not a single one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.24,
      "end_seconds": 74.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "Anything with your heart, like skipped beats or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.59,
      "end_seconds": 80.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "no, you know, nothing with my heart"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.79,
      "end_seconds": 84.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Is your mobility otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.97,
      "end_seconds": 87.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.47,
      "end_seconds": 91.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.15,
      "end_seconds": 97.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "No, not at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.68,
      "end_seconds": 102.76,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "any inherited conditions that you know of in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.59,
      "end_seconds": 109.35,
      "duration_seconds": 4.76,
      "text": "sorry, what was I saying, my sister had breast cancer"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.15,
      "end_seconds": 116.13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.98,
      "text": "So, do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.75,
      "end_seconds": 123.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "No, nothing at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.17,
      "end_seconds": 129.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.47,
      "text": "Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.84,
      "end_seconds": 142.14,
      "duration_seconds": 11.3,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop. I hardly move around during the day. I look after my grandchildren most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.63,
      "end_seconds": 149.02,
      "duration_seconds": 5.39,
      "text": "Before we go further, any allergies? I'll explain everything as we go along."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.72,
      "end_seconds": 152.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Not to my knowledge, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.31,
      "end_seconds": 164.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "Is there any regular medication you use?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.99,
      "end_seconds": 167.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.11,
      "text": "No, none."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.15,
      "end_seconds": 172.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "okay, shall I start the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 186.59,
      "end_seconds": 187.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.06,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.04,
      "end_seconds": 190.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8,
      "text": "Let me feel here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.53,
      "end_seconds": 215.52,
      "duration_seconds": 7.99,
      "text": "There is a soft swelling at the edge of the back passage and and a non-tender rectum with no mass."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 216.38,
      "end_seconds": 217.3,
      "duration_seconds": 0.92,
      "text": "that's alright"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.17,
      "end_seconds": 238.26,
      "duration_seconds": 15.09,
      "text": "You can sit up now. Having listened and examined, I think we're dealing with haemorrhoids at this stage. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 239.87,
      "end_seconds": 243.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "I'm scared it's something bad. Is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.78,
      "end_seconds": 252.31,
      "duration_seconds": 7.53,
      "text": "nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like haemorrhoids, but I'd like to confirm"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.92,
      "end_seconds": 266.24,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "Let's book a blood count to look into rectal bleeding."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 267.47,
      "end_seconds": 269.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Okay, I'll do it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.43,
      "end_seconds": 293.39,
      "duration_seconds": 21.96,
      "text": "I'll start you on a haemorrhoid cream, 1 application, twice a day, one week. That's for haemorrhoids. Eat more fibre and drink water. Cut down on salt and fried food for now, it really does make a difference. If the symptoms get worse, or you feel really unwell, please come to the emergency department."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 294.53,
      "end_seconds": 296.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.51,
      "text": "Alright, I follow."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 297.93,
      "end_seconds": 302.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.33,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again in four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 303.37,
      "end_seconds": 304.07,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.81,
      "end_seconds": 310.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.58,
      "text": "right, that's the plan do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 311.39,
      "end_seconds": 315.44,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    }
  ]
